      "text": "日暮苍山远",
      "pinyin": "rì mù cāng shān yuǎn",
      "cn": "暮色苍茫，远处的群山显得分外遥远",
      "en": "At dusk, the dark green mountains look far away,",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p28_l1.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "天寒白屋贫",
      "pinyin": "tiān hán bái wū pín",
      "cn": "天气寒冷，茅草屋显得格外贫寒",
      "en": "In the cold weather, the thatched cottage appears poor.",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p28_l2.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "柴门闻犬吠",
      "pinyin": "chái mén wén quǎn fèi",
      "cn": "听到柴门外传来狗的叫声",
      "en": "I hear a dog barking outside the brushwood gate,",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p28_l3.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "风雪夜归人",
      "pinyin": "fēng xuě yè guī rén",
      "cn": "原来是风雪之夜归来的人",
      "en": "A traveler returning through the wind and snow at night.",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p28_l4.webp"
    }
